# match_branch_valid.meridian
# Compiles cleanly — branch-on / match-arm surface for explain, drift, and trace.

To process an order placed by a customer:
  branch on the order's status:
    "approved":
      complete with reason "approved".
    "pending":
      complete with reason "pending".
    anything:
      complete with reason "unhandled status".
